@startuml HU01_Autenticacion_Web3
title HU-01 — Autenticación Web3\nDIP (IWalletConnector) + JWT + Singleton DB (Sprint 1 · DeFi360)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2E75B6
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF3FB
skinparam noteBorderColor #F0A500
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1

actor       "Usuario"                         as User
boundary    "Frontend (React)"               as UI
control     "authController"                 as AC
participant "<<interface>>\nIWalletConnector" as IWC
participant "MockWalletConnectorImpl"        as MWC
participant "AuthService (JWT)"              as AS
participant "DatabaseConnection\n<<Singleton>>" as DBC
database    "PostgreSQL\n(User, Wallet)"     as DB

autonumber

note over AC, IWC
  authController.connectWallet(walletConnector = MockWalletConnectorImpl)
  depende de la abstracción IWalletConnector (DIP, inyección por parámetro).
end note

User -> UI : Clic "Conectar Wallet"
UI -> AC : POST /api/auth/connect-wallet { walletAddress }

AC -> IWC : connect(walletAddress)
IWC -> MWC : connect(walletAddress)
activate MWC

alt walletAddress válida (regex 0x + 40 hex) y sin sesión activa
    MWC --> AC : { success, sessionId }
    deactivate MWC

    AC -> DB : User.findOne({ walletAddress })
    note right of DBC
      Singleton: sequelize compartida
      (src/config/database.js).
    end note
    DB --> AC : user | null

    alt usuario nuevo
        AC -> DB : User.create({ walletAddress })
        AC -> DB : Wallet.create({ userId, totalBalance: 5000 })
        DB --> AC : user + wallet (isNewUser=true)
    else usuario existente
        AC -> DB : user.update({ lastLogin })
        DB --> AC : OK
    end

    AC -> AS : issueToken(user.id)
    AS --> AC : JWT
    AC --> UI : 200 { success, token, user, wallet }
    UI --> User : Dashboard

else walletAddress inválida
    MWC --> AC : throw Error('Dirección de wallet inválida')
    AC --> UI : 400 { message }
    UI --> User : Error de validación

else sesión duplicada
    MWC --> AC : throw Error('Ya existe una sesión activa')
    AC --> UI : 400 { message }
end

note over User, DB
  QA: src/test/authController.test.js cubre conexión exitosa,
  wallet inválida y registro/login por correo (AuthService).
end note

@enduml
